# V6 features

New in V6:
- installable phone capture PWA served from `/capture-app/`;
- synchronized video + orientation + IMU + GPS bundle upload;
- native camera-position pose ingest path;
- visual-odometry + phone-sensor fusion;
- automatic optional-model detection and activation;
- model status and controlled manifest installer;
- ONNX pair-matcher activation path for LightGlue/LoFTR-style wrappers;
- ONNX dense-flow activation path for RAFT-style wrappers;
- optional semantic/transient ONNX masking;
- CPU dynamic-character temporal tracks (`dynamic4d_tracks.npz`);
- dynamic-vs-rigid character score;
- full V6 regression runner and deployment gate.

Not falsely marked complete:
- learned 4D Gaussian deformation/training still requires a future CPU-capable model/backend;
- optional ONNX quality models are inactive until their model files are supplied;
- browser IMU does not provide ARKit-quality metric world position; native ARKit/ARCore pose export remains the best future capture upgrade.
